1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Do not pick an answer.
Teach it. Challenge it. Use it.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Most study apps test recognition.
Dekisugi starts by asking the learner to reason.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,000
No account or network is required for this route.
Free-response text is neither sent nor saved.

4
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:36,000
A queued local mission opens its bundled source.
Choose a tactic, then recall it without reading.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Recall, reasoning, and transfer still matter.
The learner's words disappear after this practice.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:04,000
A wrong choice returns a science hint
and requires another attempt.

7
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:17,000
The fixed checkpoint tests the condition
that commonly breaks the idea.

8
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:29,000
The source returns for private self-check.
Only unit, concept, count, and time stay on-device
to rotate the next mission.

9
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:42,000
System-level 200% text remains usable
without changing the learning boundary.

10
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Rehearsal only: no Store release, revenue,
live-AI approval, or school deployment is claimed.
